direction: right
Users: Users {shape: person}
DNS: Health-aware DNS {shape: cloud}
Primary: Primary region {
  App: Application {shape: rectangle}
  DB: Primary database {shape: cylinder}
}
Backup: Immutable backups {shape: stored_data}
Recovery: Recovery region {
  Standby: Warm standby {shape: rectangle}
  Replica: Database replica {shape: cylinder}
}
Runbook: Recovery runbook {shape: document}
Users -> DNS
DNS -> Primary.App: normal traffic
Primary.App -> Primary.DB
Primary.DB -> Backup: snapshots
Primary.DB -> Recovery.Replica: replicate
DNS -> Recovery.Standby: failover
Recovery.Standby -> Recovery.Replica
Runbook -> DNS: recovery procedure
